    "Goal: I am new to drawing and want to be shown how to practise each kind, not only told: V大's way played out on an example, step by step, before I try it myself.",
    "Entry (S101: the test crops imported first, so a combination copies a crop): How on a practice sheet's bar, or the How that opens by itself the first time a kind comes up in a lesson. Here every kind is reached by a lesson started from the home at the level whose first exercise is that kind (the halves and the next face by Next from the centre and the thirds); the test pack is imported first so Shape has a picture.",
    "What appears: the How card at the right under the exercise's tools, titled as before (单根线条, 找面的中心). Under the title one quiet line on what the kind trains and its week in V大's course (第 1 周 · …). Under it a small example of the kind, never the exercise in hand: for a copying kind the original and an empty frame side by side, for a box, an ellipse or a point in space the example alone, as large as the card lets it (a box's vanishing points on its horizon beside it); for a colour or a value scale the two frames and a small colour wheel. Under the example the numbered steps, each a few words, the one being drawn in ink, the others in pencil grey, every one in ink once it is over; then one paragraph saying once what red, blue, ink, dashed and the rings mean; at the foot 再看一遍 at the left and 知道了 at the right.",
